{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00071",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 7.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "So, morning. Just put your bag down anywhere. What made you decide to come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.11,
      "end_seconds": 20.26,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "Well, I've been having swollen ankles in the evening. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.08,
      "end_seconds": 24.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "so, roughly when did it it start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.42,
      "end_seconds": 38.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.98,
      "text": "Ten days, I think... sorry, about four days, I got that wrong. My family kept telling me to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.01,
      "end_seconds": 48.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.77,
      "end_seconds": 59.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.95,
      "text": "I'd say every other day. Mostly moderate. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.39,
      "end_seconds": 67.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Any a flushed face sometimes as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.87,
      "end_seconds": 72.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I mean, yeah. One week, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.42,
      "end_seconds": 81.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.55,
      "end_seconds": 94.6,
      "duration_seconds": 11.05,
      "text": "it sort of comes and goes. A five out of ten, I suppose. I did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.79,
      "end_seconds": 103.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "has there been a heavy feeling in the legs too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.65,
      "end_seconds": 107.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Oh, yes, since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.15,
      "end_seconds": 111.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Is it mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.74,
      "end_seconds": 115.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.43,
      "end_seconds": 120.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.08,
      "end_seconds": 131.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.15,
      "end_seconds": 154.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.0 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air. And blood pressure 151 over 95, pulse 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.4,
      "end_seconds": 159.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "I'd like to examine you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.61,
      "end_seconds": 163.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "let me look at this properly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.84,
      "end_seconds": 176.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "chest is clear and the neck veins aren't raised"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.55,
      "end_seconds": 190.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Okay, ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.59,
      "end_seconds": 194.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "bear with me a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.24,
      "end_seconds": 216.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "mild pitting swelling around both ankles, equal on both sides"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.07,
      "end_seconds": 229.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "okay, finished any reduced urine, one leg more swollen than the other or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.38,
      "end_seconds": 232.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.05,
      "end_seconds": 235.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "any calf pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.94,
      "end_seconds": 240.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no calf pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.8,
      "end_seconds": 245.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.46,
      "end_seconds": 247.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.14,
      "end_seconds": 253.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.07,
      "end_seconds": 258.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.06,
      "end_seconds": 261.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "any surgery in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.56,
      "end_seconds": 270.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Uh, just a hysterectomy, about twelve years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.3,
      "end_seconds": 276.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Which tablets or creams or inhalers do you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.44,
      "end_seconds": 282.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "I mean, I take amlodipine, once a day for my pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.88,
      "end_seconds": 286.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.32,
      "end_seconds": 293.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "It's 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.02,
      "end_seconds": 299.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Hm, okay. What about allergies, to to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.04,
      "end_seconds": 305.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "I mean, I've never been told I have allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.28,
      "end_seconds": 318.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "How about exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.26,
      "end_seconds": 323.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Not really, I don't get much exercise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.25,
      "end_seconds": 326.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Who's at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.01,
      "end_seconds": 336.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "It's just me and my wife at home now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.94,
      "end_seconds": 339.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.81,
      "end_seconds": 344.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.01,
      "end_seconds": 349.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Is there anything medical in your background?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.76,
      "end_seconds": 351.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.46,
      "end_seconds": 361.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is ankle swelling possibly from a blood pressure tablet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.5,
      "end_seconds": 366.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "doctor, you know, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.44,
      "end_seconds": 379.76,
      "duration_seconds": 11.32,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's ankle swelling possibly from a blood pressure tablet, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.1,
      "end_seconds": 401.93,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "Raise your legs when you're sitting and try compression socks. We'll catch up after the results are back. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.77,
      "end_seconds": 406.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, thanks."
    }
  ]
}